1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,921
A Holy Year doesn't

2
00:00:00,921 --> 00:00:02,559
come every 5 years.

3
00:00:02,559 --> 00:00:03,702
Or every 10.

4
00:00:03,702 --> 00:00:05,664
Here's why it's 2027.

5
00:00:05,664 --> 00:00:06,653
One: it only

6
00:00:06,653 --> 00:00:07,618
happens when July

7
00:00:07,618 --> 00:00:09,359
25 falls on a Sunday.

8
00:00:09,359 --> 00:00:10,575
Two: that's why

9
00:00:10,575 --> 00:00:12,094
it follows an odd rhythm:

10
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:14,563
every 6, 5, 6 and 11 years.

11
00:00:14,563 --> 00:00:15,746
Three: the last

12
00:00:15,746 --> 00:00:16,544
one lasted two

13
00:00:16,544 --> 00:00:19,130
years, 2021 and 2022,

14
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,543
because of the pandemic.

15
00:00:20,543 --> 00:00:22,696
Four: after 2027,

16
00:00:22,696 --> 00:00:23,310
the next one

17
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:25,132
isn't until 2032.

18
00:00:25,132 --> 00:00:26,606
Which one surprised you?

19
00:00:26,606 --> 00:00:28,080
Tell me in the comments.
